Package: ggtubemap
Title: Pangenome Tube Maps in 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Colin", "Diesh", email = "colin.diesh@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Wolfgang", "Beyer", role = "cph",
           comment = "sequenceTubeMap layout, bundled in inst/js")
  )
Description: Draws pangenome graphs as tube maps, the view of
    'sequenceTubeMap', with 'ggplot2'. The layout runs from the
    '@jbrowse/tubemap-core' JavaScript library in 'V8', and every tube,
    node and base comes back as polygons and text that 'ggplot2' layers
    draw, so tube maps take scales, themes and vector output like any other
    plot. It also cuts a region out of a 'gfa-to-tabix' walk file by range
    requests.
